+    /**
+     * "Whenever one or more artifact cards leave your graveyard" looks back in time (CR 603.10a):
+     * a card counts as the card it was *in the graveyard*, including card types a cross-zone grant
+     * gave it there (Biotransference: "creature cards you own that aren't on the battlefield" are
+     * artifacts). By trigger time the card is elsewhere, so [removeFromZone] freezes those types
+     * onto it as it leaves; the leave-graveyard batch detector reads them. Every graveyard
+     * departure restamps, so a stale stamp from an earlier departure is never read, and a card with
+     * no such grant (the overwhelming case) gets no component at all.
+     */
+    private fun stampGraveyardLookBackTypes(entityId: EntityId, granted: Set<String>): GameState {
